{%- comment -%}
	The Compare row of a catalog's panel on Import & export (ShelfSync in import.js): its button, which compares
	every book (a series' or an author's are compared on the Edit series page). `catalog` is the panel's prefix
	(its client's CATALOG), `title` the button's, `note` what Compare does.
{%- endcomment %}
		<div class="ioRow">
			<span class="ioLabel">Compare</span>
			<div class="rowbtns">
				<button class="iconbtn2" id="{{ catalog }}CompareBtn" title="{{ title }}">Compare</button>
			</div>
			<p class="ioNote">{{ note }}</p>
		</div>
